<div class="website-main-content">
    <section class="page-banner-breadcrumbs ">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="breadcrumbs">
                <span class="page-name">AllenKids Swaroopnagar</span><span class="seprator">></span><span class="page-name">From Chairman’s Desk</span>
                <h3 class="title-of-page">
                    From Chairman’s Desk
                </h3>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legacy-section-photo-discription From-Chairman-desk">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="col-sm-6">
                <div class="photo-section">

                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-6">
                <div class="discription-section">
                    <h3 class="section-title-color">“We cannot always build the future for our youth, but we can build our youth for the future.”</h3>
                    <p class="discription">
                        These words by Franklin D. Roosevelt perfectly describe the aim of the Superhouse Education Foundation, and to fulfill this aim the Superhouse Group forayed into the field of education more than twenty three years ago. The schools under the Superhouse
                        Education Foundation have experienced continuous progress due to our commitment to educational excellence. I am pleased to state that for the past few decades, our schools have been actively involved in raising a generation
                        of professionals who are committed, collaborative and empathetic individuals. I am proud of the alumni of our group schools, currently holding important positions in the society, thus contributing to the cause of nation building.
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        Education contributes largely towards weaving the fabric of a nation. This is reason enough, we review our efforts every year and ensure revised emphasis on making education delivery in our schools compatible with the changing needs of the society.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="page-section why-choose-allen-kids our-approach">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <p class="discription">
                        As we transition into online learning, teachers are working diligently to give the best of education even in these unprecedented times. Our trained team of teachers will continue to bring personalised learning to your children through innovative and inspiring
                        lessons. I expect them to continue putting in their best efforts and raise the bar even higher.
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        Academic excellence along with co-curricular activities and extra co-curricular activities completes the process of education. It gives me great satisfaction that Allen Kids is progressing in all its endeavours towards the overall grooming and development
                        of the personality of the students.
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        Parents are important stakeholders of any school system. I extend my gratitude for the unstinted support we have received from them at all times.
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        Best Wishes!
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        <b>Mukhtarul Amin</b>

                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        <b>Chairman</b>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

